{"articleNo":"237494","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=237494&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] 2020 창업동아리(시제품 제작비 지원)모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.05.26","hit":"6143","attachments":[{"name":"양식(신청서).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=237494&attachNo=88639"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">창업원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">창업교육센터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">에서</span></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">\"2020 </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">창업동아리</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">시제품 제작비 지원</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">)\"</span></b> </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">를 모집 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">창업동아리로 선정되는 팀에게는 제작비 등으로 지원금을 지원하니 많은 참여 부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">프로그램명&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>:</b> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">2020 </span></span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">창업동아리 지원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">시제품 제작비 지원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>참 가 대 상&nbsp;&nbsp;</b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>:</b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">재학생으로 이루어진 팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">(3</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">~5</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>일 정</b></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 1)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">신청접수 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">6. 12.(</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">금</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">), 18:00</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">까지</span></u></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 2)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">서류심사 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: 6. 15.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 3)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">발표심사 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: 6. 18.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">일정은 센터 사정에 의해 변경될 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">신청방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">메일 제출</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">메일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><a href=\"mailto:startup@kumoh.ac.kr\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">startup@kumoh.ac.kr</span></a></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">메일 및 파일제목 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">: 2020 </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">창업동아리 지원 팀명 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">- (</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">팀장명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">지원예산</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">및 참고사항</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">평균 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">1,300,000</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">/ </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">심사를 통해 팀별 차등지급</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">예산에는 </span><u><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">재료비</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">소모성 재료만 구입 가능</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">와 회의비</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(1</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">회</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, 1</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">인당 </span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">만원</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">로 구성</span></u></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">예산 작성 시 문의사항이 있으시면 센터로 연락 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">6. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">출품된 작품의 수와 수준에 따라 지원 동아리 팀 수와 비용은 변경될 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">상기 이유로 인해 선정 동아리 미달 시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">추후 수시모집을 통해 선발할 예정입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">7. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">문의처 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">창업교육센터</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; - 054-478-7897 / </span><a href=\"mailto:startup@kumoh.ac.kr\"><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">startup@kumoh.ac.kr</span></u></a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
